# STAGING build config — loaded by `astro build --mode test` (npm run build:test).
#
# COMMITTED ON PURPOSE, unlike .env.local. It holds no secrets: a public engine
# URL and nothing else. It is committed because losing it is exactly how the
# live-money bug happened — with no .env.test present, a test build silently
# falls back to .env.local and ships the PRODUCTION engine URL, and nothing
# about the resulting site looks wrong until a real card is charged.
#
# Vite still loads .env.local underneath this in test mode (verified, not
# assumed), so every other PUBLIC_ var — Supabase URL, anon key — comes from
# there. Only the values that must DIFFER on staging belong in this file.

# The staging engine: test-mode Stripe keys, test price, no cron.
PUBLIC_ENGINE_URL=https://aunt-mabel-engine-staging.rgaudet2023.workers.dev
